changeset bot message from https://github.com/Thinkmill/manypkg/pull/18 before a changeset was added\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/11481355/66183943-dc418680-e6bd-11e9-998d-e43f90a974bd.png\">\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1552\" alt=\"screenshot of the changeset bot message from https://github.com/Thinkmill/manypkg/pull/18 showing the changeset good to go message\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/11481355/66184229-cf716280-e6be-11e9-950e-0f64a31dbf15.png\">\r\n\r\n\r\nSometimes, a contributor won't add a changeset to a PR but you might want to merge in the PR without having to wait on them to add it. To address this, this bot adds a link with the filename pre-filled to add a changeset so all you have to do is write the changeset and click commit.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1552\" alt=\"screenshot of the changeset bot message from https://github.com/Thinkmill/manypkg/pull/18 focused on the create a changeset link\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/11481355/66184052-3a6e6980-e6be-11e9-8e62-8fd9d49af587.png\">\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1552\" alt=\"screenshot of creating a changeset directly on GitHub\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/11481355/66184086-5bcf5580-e6be-11e9-8227-c1ed6d96b5d2.png\">\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1552\" alt=\"screenshot of the GitHub file creation page focusing on the commit button\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/11481355/66184181-a94bc280-e6be-11e9-85fc-32edcd5b05ce.png\">\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1552\" alt=\"screenshot of the changeset bot message from https://github.com/Thinkmill/manypkg/pull/18 showing the changeset good to go message\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/11481355/66184229-cf716280-e6be-11e9-950e-0f64a31dbf15.png\">\r\n\r\nWhen writing the changeset, it should look something like this with the packages that are being released in the YAML front matter with associated semver bump types and the summary of the changes in markdown.\r\n\r\n```markdown\r\n---\r\n'@changesets/cli': major\r\n'@changesets/read': minor\r\n---\r\n\r\nA very helpful description of the changes\r\n```","external_url":"https://github.com/changesets/changesets","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/changeset-bot","created_at":"2019-04-09T00:12:46Z","updated_at":"2026-04-30T05:58:26Z","permissions":{"contents":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write"},"events":["issues","pull_request"]},"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/5716669427","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18044#issuecomment-5716669427","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/18044","id":5716669427,"node_id":"IC_kwDOFL76Q88AAAABVL1z8w","user":{"login":"pdig-tobiasbreit","id":205613620,"node_id":"U_kgDODEFqNA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/205613620?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdig-tobiasbreit","html_url":"https://github.com/pdig-tobiasbreit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdig-tobiasbreit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdig-tobiasbreit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdig-tobiasbreit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdig-tobiasbreit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdig-tobiasbreit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdig-tobiasbreit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdig-tobiasbreit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdig-tobiasbreit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdig-tobiasbreit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-17T15:09:15Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T15:09:15Z","body":":shipit: ","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/5716669427/reactions","total_count":0